# AI runtime state
# Descend into .agents/ deliberately: the shared scope evidence is versioned (docs/cli.md), while
# per-machine state and the append-only trace are not. A blanket `/.agents/` would also shadow the
# nested .gitignore install/sync writes, since git never descends into an excluded directory.
/.agents/*
!/.agents/kyro/
/.agents/kyro/*
!/.agents/kyro/.gitignore
!/.agents/kyro/project.json
!/.agents/kyro/scopes/
/.agents/kyro/**/trace/
/.agents/kyro/local.json
.cursor/
.commandcode/
openspec/
presentation-assets/
.antigravity/
.antigravitycli/
